  "note": "ImageMagick has XMP profile write that triggers hang due to unbounded loop. The flaw is in the native ImageMagick library that Magick.NET bundles; managed methods that changed in the same release are unrelated, and the native code is reached through many managed entry points, so no method can be named.",
